# Conformance probe pack for the derive functions added in spec 0.8:
# `day_seconds`, `any`, `not`, `parse_int` and `text_of`. Public. No kinds.
# The first six members are inputs; the last five are the keys the `derive`
# lines of model/probe.def set from them.
format  conformance-derive-functions
version 0.8.0
distribution public
source  "goat-transformers spec/engine-spec.md (synthetic probe format, no external standard)"
uses    probe
wire    json
field   time_ms       t       iso8601_ms
field   probe.x       x       int
field   probe.y       y       int
field   probe.z       z       int
field   probe.s1      s1      string
field   probe.n       n       int
field   probe.ds      ds      float
field   probe.any1    any     int
field   probe.notx    notx    int
field   probe.parsed  parsed  int
field   probe.text    text    string
